/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 The consultant and the case folder Imagine hiring a knowledgeable consultant who receives one case folder at a time\056 The folder contains your brief\054 relevant records and forms for requesting work from other departments\056 The consultant returns an explanation or a completed request form\056 Your office checks the request and performs any authorized work\056 For the next consultation\054 you prepare another folder containing the information needed to continue\056 Where it stops\072 the consultant represents a model endpoint\054 not a person with intentions\056 A model has knowledge learned during training\054 and provider services may retain conversation or reasoning state\056 Your application must understand those services rather than assume the folder contains every kind of state\056)
>>
endobj
3396 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 3329 0 R
/Pg 295 0 R
/K 0
/Alt (VISUAL LAB 1A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 What goes into this consultation\077\056 ShopAssist prepares a second consultation about ORD\055104233\056 The first lookup found two captures\073 no refund has been approved\056\056 Call folder\056 Order\072 ORD\055104233\056 Captures\072 PAY\055A and PAY\055B\056 Policy\072 duplicate\055v3\056 Retained run\056 Lookup result\072 OBS\0557\056 Continuation\072 opaque REF\0559\056 Refund status\072 not proposed\056 Action desk\056 Allowed\072 own\055order lookup\056 Refund needs exact approval\056 Verify external receipt\056 The call folder selects retained\054 permitted facts\056\056 Action checks apply to every proposed operation\056\056 Inspect the payment identifiers supplied to this call\056\056 The continuation reference stays in the runtime\054 where the adapter can preserve required provider items\056\056 The action desk decides whether a proposal may execute\056\056 PREDICT\056 If the next folder omits OBS\0557\054 may the model assume the duplicate captures still exist\077\056 A call receives selected evidence\073 authority remains outside the generated response\056\056 Fictional records\073 folder contents simplify serialized context\056 Provider continuation requirements vary\054 and the consultant analogy supplies no human accountability\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
endobj
