/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 The editor organizing a reporting desk An editor can assign a reporter to one specialist desk\054 approve an outline before research\054 let the reporter follow each new lead or ask another editor to verify the final story\056 Several reporters can cover independent parts and return notes\056 These are different ways of organizing the same work\054 not a ladder from weak journalism to strong journalism\056 Where it stops\072 a software critic may share the generator\047s errors\054 and an agent\047s evidence and permissions require explicit machine\055enforced contracts\056 A second opinion is not independent merely because it comes from another model call\056)
>>
endobj
