/Alt (VISUAL LAB 3A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 An editor checks the cited passage\056 ShopAssist drafts three claims\056 The reviewer opens the cited records instead of merely rereading the draft\056\056 CLAIMS\056 PASSAGES\056 C1\056 PAY\055B is a captured duplicate of PAY\055A\056\056 S1\056 Ledger\072 PAY\055A and PAY\055B captured for ORD\055104233\073 duplicate flag confirmed\056\056 C2\056 PAY\055B has already been refunded\056\056 S2\056 Refund ledger\072 PAY\055B refunded amount is 0 minor units\056\056 C3\056 The customer will receive funds tomorrow\056\056 S3\056 Policy v3\072 eligible duplicates may be refunded after required approval\056\056 SUPPORTS\056 CONFLICTS\056 INSUFFICIENT\056 Retain C1\073 correct C2\073 remove or qualify unsupported timing C3\056\056 C1 has matching transaction evidence\056\056 C2 conflicts with the authoritative refund ledger\056\056 S3 gives eligibility\054 not a next\055day arrival guarantee\056\056 PREDICT\056 Would a second reviewer reading only the same draft resolve C2\077\056 Review adds value when it contributes a concrete check or new evidence\056\056 Fictional excerpts\073 the editor analogy does not make model reviewers independent\056 No critic accuracy is measured here\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
