/Alt (VISUAL LAB 3B \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Count calls before comparing patterns\056 These four constructed traces solve the same read\055only support question\056 Count all model invocations\054 including planning\054 review and reduction\056\056 0\056 5 model calls\056 Router \053 fixed handler\056 2 model calls\056 ReAct\072 4 decisions\056 4 model calls\056 Plan \053 3 steps \053 answer\056 5 model calls\056 4 workers \053 reducer\056 5 model calls\056 Scripts count calls only\073 equal totals do not imply equal tokens\054 quality or latency\056\056 The router trace includes one routing call and one drafting call\056\056 The planning trace pays for the plan and final synthesis\056\056 The parallel trace still pays for all four workers and reduction\056\056 PREDICT\056 If the four workers run together\054 does the parallel trace fall from 5 calls to 2\077\056 Parallel scheduling changes overlap\073 it does not erase worker or reducer work\056\056 Constructed call counts\054 not measurements\056 Each named step invokes one model\073 authorized tool reads are excluded from this unit\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
