/Alt (VISUAL LAB 3C \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Replan the remaining work\054 keep completed facts\056 ShopAssist plans to investigate PAY\055B and possibly propose its refund\056 An authorized lookup discovers that RF\0559 already refunded the full captured balance\056 The plan must respond to that fact\056\056 Before lookup\056 Proposed plan\054 not execution\056 lookup\056 pending\056 refund step\056 conditional proposal\056 next\056 read PAY\055B\056 After observation\056 Service confirms full refund RF\0559\056 lookup\056 complete\072 RF\0559 found\056 refund step\056 needs reassessment\056 next\056 revise remaining plan\056 After replanning\056 No refundable balance remains\056 lookup\056 complete\072 RF\0559 found\056 refund step\056 skipped\072 already refunded\056 next\056 explain confirmed RF\0559\056 The completed lookup and confirmed receipt survive every plan revision\056\056 Green edge \075 changed field\073 gray \075 retained field\056\056 The first plan describes conditional work\054 not a promise to execute\056\056 The observation supplies an authoritative reason to change the next step\056\056 Replanning changes the remaining proposal while preserving the completed lookup\056\056 PREDICT\056 Should replanning mark the lookup pending again simply because the plan text changed\077\056 Adapt the path to new observations without rewriting completed history\056\056 Fictional plan states\073 RF\0559 fully refunds PAY\055B and is current\056 No new refund was submitted\054 and explanation acceptance remains task\055specific\056\056 Check your prediction\056 R03 \057 ReAct\072 observation\055driven plan updates)
>>
