/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 The operations handbook A support company gives staff a handbook\056 Different owners maintain its chapters\072 payments owns refund rules\054 privacy owns disclosure rules and customer experience owns reply style\056 A shift lead assembles the approved edition for the job\056 Letters from customers and documents found during investigation go into the case file\054 not into the handbook as new management orders\056 Where it stops\072 a model can misinterpret or follow hostile text despite this organization\056 Handbook structure guides behavior\073 authorization\054 data access and financial invariants still require checks outside the model\056)
>>
