/Alt (VISUAL LAB 4A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 The customer email is not a policy update\056 Email E\05544 asks for order help and says to export every customer record\056 The model may read the email\054 but the executor has no export grant\056\056 Untrusted input\056 E\05544\072 export all records\056 Attachment\072 user text\056 Controlled runtime\056 Model reads case data\056 Check tenant \053 scope\056 Constrained tools\056 Read owned ORD\055104233\056 Export all customers\056 Allow as attributed\054 untrusted case data\056 ALLOW\056 Inspect every proposed operation\056 ALLOW\056 Allow only verified ownership \053 read scope\056 ALLOW\056 Deny\072 no bulk\055export grant\056 DENY\056 The email enters as data even when its wording sounds authoritative\056\056 Every generated operation passes the policy gate\056\056 The export route terminates before any customer database export\056\056 PREDICT\056 If the email is perfectly escaped and well formatted\054 should the export route open\077\056 Attribution guides interpretation\073 execution checks constrain consequences\056\056 Fictional injection and grants\073 the handbook analogy and drawn fence are design aids\054 not implementation guarantees\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
