/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 A change of shift in a hospital When a nurse\047s shift ends\054 the incoming nurse needs the current chart\072 medication already given\054 tests pending\054 observations\054 limits and the next action\056 A brief consultation note is useful but is not the whole chart\054 and the patient\047s long\055term history serves another purpose\056 The new nurse reads the handover and checks current instruments before continuing\056 Where it stops\072 a written chart cannot by itself prevent two nurses acting simultaneously\056 Software needs ownership\054 transactional updates and external effect contracts as well as a good handover record\056)
>>
