/Alt (VISUAL LAB 7B \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 A stale worker must stop at the effect gate\056 Worker A resumes with epoch 8 after worker B acquired epoch 9\056 Both the state store and payment gateway enforce the current epoch\056\056 Worker claims\056 A\072 stale epoch 8\056 B\072 current epoch 9\056 Enforced checks\056 State version \053 epoch\056 Effect epoch must be 9\056 Protected records\056 Run R\05542 state\056 K\05517 refund submission\056 Deny stale state update\056 DENY\056 Deny stale external mutation\056 DENY\056 Current epoch\073 other gates already pass\056 ALLOW\056 Forward protected intent K\05517\056 ALLOW\056 Worker A can wake after its lease expires\056\056 The state check and the effect check protect different consequences\056\056 Only the current\054 otherwise authorized intent reaches the payment gateway\056\056 PREDICT\056 What breaks if the payment gateway ignores the epoch while state writes still reject epoch 8\077\056 Ownership must be enforced where the protected effect occurs\056\056 Fictional enforced gateway contract\073 worker claims are untrusted until checked\056 Other authorization gates pass only for B\073 the fence is not self\055enforcing\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
