/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 Packing a suitcase for a specific trip A traveler with a weight limit packs essential documents and medicine first\054 then clothing suited to the destination\054 then optional items if there is room\056 A packing list records what went in\073 prohibited items never enter the bag\056 Repacking from a pile of old souvenirs without checking the trip would produce a heavy\054 unhelpful suitcase\056 Where it stops\072 token limits are not a simple weight limit\056 Message overhead\054 output and reasoning allowances vary by provider\054 and a passage\047s usefulness depends on meaning\054 not only its size\056 The packing list also cannot prove that the traveler interprets an item correctly\056)
>>
