/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 A shopkeeper\047s customer file A careful shopkeeper keeps a small customer file\072 preferred language\054 delivery instructions and dated notes about earlier problems\056 The current order stays on the working counter\054 today\047s conversation stays in the session notes and the store\047s approved procedures stay in its handbook\056 Changed preferences update the file with history\054 and unwanted records can be removed\056 Where it stops\072 software can copy one note into indexes\054 summaries and caches instantly\056 Correcting or deleting it requires lineage and coordinated storage behavior\073 a friendly promise to forget is not evidence that all copies disappeared\056)
