/Alt (VISUAL LAB 9A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 One customer\054 three different records\056 Customer C\0557 returns for support\056 ShopAssist has a pending refund\054 session details and a governed customer file with different validity rules\056\056 Working counter\056 Run\072 R\05542\056 Intent\072 K\05517 pending\056 Balance\072 refresh before effect\056 Session notes\056 Session\072 S\05518\056 User asks about ORD\055104233\056 Promise\072 report actual outcome\056 Customer file\056 Subject\072 tenant T\0551 \057 C\0557\056 Language\072 Hindi\073 user stated\056 Episode\072 RF\0554 resolved in June\056 Relevant file facts may enter this session view\056\056 Current balances come from the payment service\056\056 Language preference can help across sessions under its retention policy\056\056 The prior refund episode describes history\054 not current eligibility\056\056 The pending intent remains exact execution state on the working counter\056\056 PREDICT\056 Which record should establish the current refundable balance\072 the June episode or the payment service\077\056 A record\047s purpose and authority determine its use\054 not how easily it can be recalled\056\056 Fictional customer records\073 tiers describe use\054 not storage speed\056 Unlike a paper file\054 software copies require tracked correction and deletion\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
