/Alt (VISUAL LAB 10C \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Unread helper code can still create token overhead\056 A refund kit uses a 6000\055token envelope\056 Helper code runs in an authorized sandbox\073 the model receives its invocation and result\054 not its full source\056 All values are constructed\056\056 CAPACITY \057 6000 tokens\056 1\056 2\056 3\056 4\056 Catalog \053 protocol\056 600 tokens\056 Selected instructions\056 1800 tokens\056 Resource \053 call \053 result\056 1600 tokens\056 Reserved output\056 2000 tokens\056 LEFT OUT OF THIS CALL\056 Unselected skill bodies\056 Descriptions suffice for this selection\056 Helper source\072 4000 tokens\056 Not read by model\073 its call\057result counted\056 The serialized input occupies 4000 tokens\073 output capacity reserves another 2000\056\056 The selected resource\054 invocation and helper result occupy the 1600\055token segment\056\056 Unread source code remains an executable artifact governed by sandbox and permission policy\056\056 PREDICT\056 Does keeping 4000 tokens of helper source outside this call make the helper token overhead zero\077\056 Progressive disclosure avoids unnecessary source loading\054 not all information or execution cost\056\056 Constructed provider envelope includes protocol overhead and no separate reasoning reserve\056 Source code is executed without model inspection\073 output capacity is not input\056\056 Check your prediction\056 R10 \057 Agent Skills\072 progressive disclosure)
