/Type /StructElem
/S /Note
/P 3329 0 R
/Pg 109 0 R
/K 3
/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 Building a small working model railway A model railway can teach signals\054 track ownership\054 station holds and a control\055room record without carrying real passengers\056 Each added component should demonstrate a specific behavior\072 a signal prevents a train entering\054 a station hold preserves its position and a journey record explains completion\056 Where it stops\072 a working model is not a certified railway\056 This harness establishes its local contracts through deterministic checks\073 real providers\054 credentials\054 network deadlines\054 distributed ownership and production retention need further implementation and evidence\056)
>>
endobj
4209 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 3329 0 R
/Pg 496 0 R
/K 0
/Alt (VISUAL LAB 11A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 The model train does not receive a new allowance\056 The scripted harness starts with 3 model accounting units\056 Each scripted response reserves and consumes exactly 1\073 approval waiting consumes none\056\056 AVAILABLE AT START\056 3 model units\056 EVENT \057 CHANGE\056 BALANCE AFTER EVENT\056 Response 1\072 request payment lookup\056 \0551\056 2 model units\056 Response 2\072 propose refund\056 \0551\056 1 model units\056 Wait\054 restart and valid review\056 \0530\056 1 model units\056 Response 3\072 final completion claim\056 \0551\056 0 model units\056 Reserve and settle 1 per response\056 Restart preserves used units and the absolute deadline\056\056 The first two responses leave 1 unit available\056\056 Review and process restart do not replenish the ledger\056\056 The last unit buys a claim that still requires independent verification\056\056 PREDICT\056 After the final response\054 may a fourth scripted response run because the process restarted\077\056 Durable limits count consumed work across waiting and restart\056\056 Constructed companion accounting\072 each response costs exactly 1 unit\054 reserved before generation\056 No currency\054 token pricing or concurrent\055permit guarantee is implied\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
endobj
