/Alt (Figure 11\0561\056 The small harness grows by responsibility\056 These conceptual layers do not encode source\055code size\056 Each stage should fix a demonstrated failure\054 not simply add abstraction\056 Diagram labels in reading order\072 Request contracts\073 Structured calls with exact units and identifiers\056\073 Controller and limits\073 Stored script position and checks at each boundary\056\073 Authority and review\073 Owned resource\054 current scope and bound approval\056\073 Durable intent and state\073 SQLite record before the separate external effect\056\073 Effect and verification\073 Atomic fake payment deduplication plus acceptance read\056\073 Events and checks\073 Explain outcomes and prove the scoped contracts\056)
>>
