/K 0
/Alt (Figure 11\0562\056 The stored review position\056 Resuming never replenishes consumed usage or changes the original deadline\056 Waiting is a retained execution position\054 not a blocked prompt\056 Diagram labels in reading order\072 Running\073 Validated owned payment proposal reaches the executor\056\073 Waiting\073 Call\054 effect binding and expiry are saved\056\073 Accepted intent\073 Valid review is recorded before submission\056\073 Effect confirmed\073 Authoritative fake\055service result enters the ledger\056\073 Verified complete\073 Final claim is checked against the service result\056\073 Denied\073 Rejection produces no financial effect\056\073 Expired or limited\073 Review expiry differs from the absolute run deadline\056\073 Unresolved intent\073 A crash requires reconciliation before continuation\056)
>>
endobj
4236 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 3329 0 R
/Pg 611 0 R
/K 0
/Alt (VISUAL LAB 11B \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Crash where the two databases disagree\056 A valid approved refund reaches the companion\047s separate payment database\056 The process exits before the run database receives its result checkpoint\056\056 Run database\056 Payment database\056 Worker\056 1\056 Save approved K\05517\072 pending\056 2\056 Atomically commit RF\0559 \053 key\056 3\056 Exit before result save\056 4\056 Reload pending K\05517\056 5\056 Read RF\0559 by retained key\056 Verify RF\0559\054 then save confirmed state\073 service refund count\072 1\056\056 Event positions show order\054 not elapsed duration\056\056 The run record still says pending after the payment commit\056\056 The new worker keeps the original identity and consumed allowances\056\056 The service\047s atomic key record resolves the uncertain window\056\056 PREDICT\056 If the absolute deadline expired before step 4\054 does the companion automatically finish this recovery\077\056 Test the crash after external commit and before local confirmation\056\056 Fictional trace of the companion contract\072 one writer\054 local synchronous SQLite\054 unexpired authority and deadline on the shown recovery path\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
endobj
