/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 Preparing an open\055book examination A student preparing an open\055book exam marks section boundaries\054 keeps an index and knows which edition of each text is current\056 During the exam\054 the student finds candidate pages\054 reads the best ones carefully and cites them in the answer\056 More books do not help if their pages are torn or the relevant paragraph cannot be found\056 Where it stops\072 a citation does not prove that the cited page supports the claim\056 Software must separately check document access\054 current validity\054 citation completeness and support\073 an answer can cite a real page while misreading it\056)
