/Alt (VISUAL LAB 13B \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Four search rounds can add only three facts\056 Constructed rounds return 3\054 3\054 2 and 1 candidates\056 After permission\054 relevance and stable\055identity checks\054 only three unique records enter the ledger\056\056 0\056 2 new ledger records\056 Round 1\072 2 unique accepted\056 2 new ledger records\056 Round 2\072 repeats only\056 0 new ledger records\056 Round 3\072 1 new relevant\056 1 new ledger records\056 Round 4\072 new but irrelevant\056 0 new ledger records\056 Key\072 source \053 version \053 locator\056 Count only new\054 permitted\054 relevant records\056\056 Round 1 accepts E1 and E2\073 its third candidate duplicates E1\056\056 Round 3 accepts E3 and discards a repeated E2\056\056 Round 4 has a new identity but no relevance to the required gap\056\056 PREDICT\056 After round 4\054 does another identical query promise progress because the candidate list grew\077\056 Progress counts new relevant evidence\054 not repeated arrivals or unrelated novelty\056\056 Constructed counts\054 not retrieval measurements\056 Four rounds use an allowance of 4\073 identical retries require a separate freshness or wait contract\056\056 Check your prediction)
