/Alt (VISUAL LAB 14A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 One connection\054 two different catalogs\056 AegisOps connects to the approved observability server\056 Its model may inspect latency\054 but the server also advertises a restart capability\056 Inspect what each container actually owns\056\056 Host registry\056 Exposed\072 obs\056query\137latency\056 Pinned contract\072 hash 7ac\056 Restart tool\072 withheld\056 Client connection\056 Server\072 observability\056 Compatible protocol selected\056 Carries checked invocations\056 Server catalog\056 query\137latency\050service\054 window\051\056 restart\137service\050service\051\056 Backend checks each request\056 Host chooses which contracts reach its model\056\056 Client connects to server\073 it grants no authority\056\056 Compare the host list with the larger server catalog\056\056 The connection transports requests\073 it does not choose task permissions\056\056 The server still checks each invocation against its resource policy\056\056 PREDICT\056 Does advertising restart\137service make it callable by the model\077\056 Discovery describes capabilities\073 the host chooses exposure\056\056 Fictional registry\073 compatible transport is assumed\056 Containers show ownership\054 not an execution sequence\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
