/Alt (VISUAL LAB 14C \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 One read crosses two credential boundaries\056 AegisOps requests an authorized checkout latency read through obs\055mcp\056 Compare two credential configurations for the same request\073 the backend is metrics\055api\056\056 One checkout read\072 host \055\076 obs\055mcp \055\076 metrics\055api\056\056 Reuse backend token\056 Host offers token with audience metrics\055api\056 obs\055mcp detects it was issued elsewhere\056 Reject before invoking the read handler\056 No read\072 a backend credential is not an MCP credential\056 Separate audiences\056 Host offers valid token for obs\055mcp\056 Broker supplies scoped metrics\055api credential\056 Backend checks principal\054 scope and service\056 Read proceeds only after both boundaries authorize it\056 The requested business operation is identical on both sides\056\056 The left token is valid for a different service\056\056 The right path obtains appropriate credentials and checks authority at each boundary\056\056 PREDICT\056 Can changing the audience text locally repair the left credential\077\056 Credentials must be issued for the boundary that validates them\056\056 Fictional profiles\073 both services enforce trusted identity\054 current scope and resource policy\056 Credentials stay outside model context\056\056 Check your prediction\056 R14 \057 MCP security\072 token passthrough)
>>
