/Alt (VISUAL LAB 15A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 A question does not create a second investigation\056 The database worker accepts incident INC\05577 as task T\055904\054 then needs a cluster identifier\056 The commander owns the incident throughout this delegated investigation\056\056 Commander\056 DB worker\056 Task record\056 09\07200\056 Send INC\05577 diagnosis brief\056 09\07201\056 Accept as task T\055904\056 09\07202\056 Save T\055904\073 input required\056 09\07208\056 Reply\072 cluster nw\055db\0552\056 09\07209\056 Continue T\055904 diagnosis\056 WAIT\072 Wait for an authorized cluster ID\056 One task continues\073 artifact acceptance remains pending\056\056 Event positions show order\054 not elapsed duration\056\056 Follow T\055904 across the pause and continuation\056\056 The saved task survives the missing\055information wait\056\056 The commander remains responsible for the incident and final decision\056\056 PREDICT\056 Should the commander submit a new diagnosis task when the cluster becomes known\077\056 Continue the owned task when supplying missing input\056\056 Fictional events\073 authenticated messages and durable storage are assumed\056 A2A work ownership does not depend on task duration\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
