/Alt (VISUAL LAB 15B \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Recovering a lost task\055creation response\056 Both callers persisted delegation D\05577\056 The worker accepted the job\054 but its creation response was lost before either caller learned the remote task ID\056\056 D\05577 exists locally\073 remote creation response is missing\056\056 Agreed remote dedupe\056 Contract retains D\05577 mappings for 24 hours\056 Retry same key and identical brief at 5 min\056 Atomic mapping returns original task T\055904\056 Bind D\05577 to T\055904\073 continue the existing investigation\056 No dedupe contract\056 Same message ID has no promised dedupe\056 Record creation outcome as unknown\056 Reconcile with the owner before resubmission\056 Wait for task identification\073 do not create replacement work\056 Both callers saved the same local logical identity\056\056 Only the left service promises atomic remote deduplication\056\056 The right caller preserves uncertainty instead of guessing that creation failed\056\056 PREDICT\056 Can the right caller obtain the left outcome merely by reusing its message ID\077\056 A local key needs a remote recovery contract\056\056 Fictional adapter extension\073 the left retry occurs inside its retention window\056 A2A itself does not require this behavior\056\056 Check your prediction)
