/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 The railway and its stations A railway map defines stations\054 connecting tracks and signals that choose a route\056 A train cannot invent a new track simply because a passenger asks\056 A platform can hold it while other trains continue\056 Nodes\054 edges\054 routers and durable waits serve similar purposes in a workflow\056 Where it stops\072 a permitted station can still perform the wrong work\056 Safe routing does not constrain the tools a node holds\054 prove an approval is valid or make a checkpoint durable by itself\056)
