/Alt (VISUAL LAB 16A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Two return tracks share one attempt guard\056 AegisOps has only two reasons to re\055enter investigation\072 an evaluator needs evidence\054 or post\055action verification failed\056 Each investigation entry increments one persisted counter\073 the limit is 3\056\056 Retry reaches the investigation guard\056 Evaluator retry\056 attempts \074 3 before re\055entry\077\056 YES\056 Enter\073 increment before reading\056 NO\056 Escalate with current evidence\056 Verification retry\056 attempts \074 3 before re\055entry\077\056 YES\056 Record effect\073 enter and increment\056 NO\056 Stop as not recovered\073 retain effect\056 The root partitions the two stated retry causes\056\056 Both branches test the same counter before entering investigation\056\056 Failed verification preserves the action history even when the loop stops\056\056 PREDICT\056 With attempts \075 3 and failed verification\054 may the graph investigate once more\077\056 Guard every entrance to a loop with a shared invariant\056\056 Fictional bounded graph\073 only the two displayed retry causes exist\056 Persistence and executor authorization are separate required controls\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
