/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 A cheque awaiting a second signature A prepared cheque records the payee and amount\056 It can wait in a tray until an entitled signer decides\054 without an employee standing beside it all afternoon\056 If someone changes the payee or amount\054 the old signature does not authorise the new cheque\056 An agent proposal\054 durable approval request and validated resume follow that pattern\056 Where it stops\072 a signature does not prove the payment is sensible or that its preconditions still hold\056 Software must check decision identity\054 current authority and resource state before executing\056)
>>
