/Alt (PART V \057 LEARNING MAP\056 Security\054 Identity \046 Governance\056 A READING ROUTE\054 NOT AN EXECUTION SEQUENCE\056 19\056 Security fundamentals\056 Treat untrusted content as data\056\056 20\056 Identity and access\056 Check who can act on which resource\056\056 21\056 Sandboxing\056 Contain execution and its escape routes\056\056 22\056 Governance and privacy\056 Make policy observable and enforceable\056\056 WHAT YOU CAN EXPLAIN OR BUILD\056 Define who may act\054 where execution occurs and what data may leave\056)
