/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 A bank clerk with limited keys A clerk reads letters from customers and can be deceived by a convincing request\056 The bank does not give every clerk a vault key and rely only on training\056 It restricts accounts\054 amounts and recipients\054 and requires independent checks for consequential transfers\056 An agent should likewise have only the tools and authority needed for the task\056 Where it stops\072 software permissions can be misconfigured\054 and permitted actions can still be harmful\056 Each rule needs enforcement\054 testing and monitoring rather than a reassuring name\056)
>>
endobj
