/Alt (VISUAL LAB 19A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Trace the stolen invoice route to its stop\056 The user authorized an unread\055mail summary\056 Message M\05552 contains an instruction to leak invoice INV\0559 through email or a tracking image\056 The summary task has no external\055send authority\056\056 Mailbox data\056 M\05552\072 untrusted text\056 INV\0559\072 private invoice\056 Task runtime\056 Summary reader\056 Egress policy gate\056 Destinations\056 Requesting user\056 Outside inbox \057 image\056 Allowed read\073 embedded commands are data\056 ALLOW\056 Read within user mailbox entitlement\056 ALLOW\056 Release scoped summary to its requester\056 ALLOW\056 Deny external send and remote image fetch\056 DENY\056 The reader may encounter both hostile text and private data\056\056 The four routes show checks on access and release\054 not every internal hop\056\056 External disclosure is blocked at sender and renderer boundaries\056\056 PREDICT\056 Does removing the email\055send tool alone close the shown image route\077\056 Inspect every outbound channel that can carry private data\056\056 Fictional enforced controls\073 trust zones illustrate required boundaries\054 not proof of isolation\056 Permitted summaries remain subject to data\055minimization policy\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
endobj
