/Alt (VISUAL LAB 19B \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 An approved hostname can redirect elsewhere\056 A URL\055fetch tool allows HTTPS on docs\056vendor\056test\056 In this constructed case\054 every request either has no redirect or exactly one redirect\073 all eventual connections undergo destination checks\056\056 Request starts at https\072\057\057docs\056vendor\056test\056 No redirect\056 Resolved IP and port allowed at connect\077\056 YES\056 Fetch within output and time bounds\056 NO\056 Deny internal or disallowed target\056 One redirect\056 New URL and resolved destination allowed\077\056 YES\056 Fetch approved destination with bounds\056 NO\056 Stop before redirected connection\056 An approved original hostname does not settle the connection decision\056\056 Redirects introduce a new URL and destination to validate\056\056 Network enforcement must agree with the address actually contacted\056\056 PREDICT\056 A redirect targets a private metadata address\056 Which leaf should the request reach\077\056 Validate each actual network destination\054 including redirects\056\056 Constructed one\055redirect case\073 additional redirects are rejected\056 The diagram assumes connection\055time network enforcement\054 not only a preliminary URL string check\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
endobj
