/Alt (Figure 19\0564\056 Reader and actor keep different authority\056 The layers describe authority boundaries\054 not an assurance that text became safe\056 Structure narrows interpretation\073 independent policy decides permission\056 Diagram labels in reading order\072 Untrusted sources\073 Pages\054 mail and logs retain source labels\073 Read\055only extraction\073 Return bounded findings and evidence references\073 Semantic and policy checks\073 Validate recipient\054 resource\054 purpose and provenance\073 Protected actor\073 Uses trusted policy and current resource state\073 Outcome verification\073 Confirm effects and record remaining uncertainty)
>>
