/Pg 1637 0 R
/K 0
/Alt (VISUAL LAB 19C \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 The fields match\054 but the advertised tool changed\056 AegisOps pinned a reviewed tool definition\056 A later catalog keeps the same input schema but changes its description to request an unrelated export\056 The host compares the entire definition before exposure\056\056 Reviewed catalog\056 Pin complete definition d9a\056 input\137schema\056 s11\056 definition\056 d9a\056 exposure\056 reviewed release\056 Catalog refresh\056 Schema same\073 description changed\056 input\137schema\056 s11\056 definition\056 b72\056 exposure\056 drift detected\056 Before next use\056 Reject unreviewed definition b72\056 input\137schema\056 s11\056 definition\056 b72\056 exposure\056 withheld pending review\056 Matching input fields cannot validate a changed whole tool definition\056\056 Green edge \075 changed field\073 gray \075 retained field\056\056 The input schema identifier never changes\056\056 The full definition digest changes when the description changes\056\056 The host withholds the changed tool instead of treating discovery as approval\056\056 PREDICT\056 Would an unchanged full definition hash prove the server implementation stayed unchanged\077\056 Pin the complete contract\054 then retain independent runtime controls\056\056 Fictional immutable definitions\073 digests abbreviated\056 The trusted host canonicalizes all definition fields and enforces withholding before model exposure\056\056 Check your prediction\056 R19 \057 OWASP\072 MCP tool definition integrity)
>>
endobj
