/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 A courier collecting one document An account holder asks a licensed courier to collect a document from a bank\056 The bank checks the account holder\047s permission and the courier\047s identity\054 then issues a pass for that collection rather than a master key\056 The requested service\054 requester and limited credential are distinct\056 Where it stops\072 a digital bearer token can be reused during its lifetime unless additional controls prevent that\056 A pass also needs validation at the destination\073 merely printing restrictions on it does not enforce them\056)
>>
