/Alt (VISUAL LAB 20C \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 A cache hit does not revive revoked access\056 At 10\07200\054 Priya may read order O\055481 and ShopAssist caches its result for 10 minutes\056 At 10\07202\054 her order access is revoked\056 The next request arrives before cache expiry\056\056 10\07200 first read\056 Cache authorized result C\0557\056 principal\056 Priya \057 Northwind\056 permission\056 epoch 41\072 allow\056 release\056 C\0557 returned\056 10\07202 revocation\056 Trusted policy removes access\056 principal\056 Priya \057 Northwind\056 permission\056 epoch 42\072 deny\056 release\056 C\0557 remains stored\056 10\07203 cache hit\056 Recheck current permission\056 principal\056 Priya \057 Northwind\056 permission\056 epoch 42\072 deny\056 release\056 deny before context\056 Cache freshness cannot replace current entitlement at release\056\056 Green edge \075 changed field\073 gray \075 retained field\056\056 Principal and tenant are unchanged\054 so those cache keys alone cannot detect revocation\056\056 The record is only 3 minutes old\054 within its 10\055minute lifetime\056\056 The current permission decision prevents cached content from entering model context\056\056 PREDICT\056 Does the remaining 7\055minute cache lifetime permit returning C\0557\077\056 Revalidate entitlement when releasing a cached result\056\056 Constructed timeline\073 permission epoch is application metadata\054 not an OAuth feature\056 Current authorization is checked before cached data reaches context\056\056 Check your prediction\056 R20 \057 OWASP\072 authorization on every request)
>>
