/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 Work inside a laboratory glovebox A technician handles uncertain material inside a glovebox rather than placing it on the office desk\056 The chamber has controlled openings\054 limited equipment and a procedure for removing samples\056 The surrounding laboratory maintains the chamber and inspects what comes out\056 A sandbox similarly contains execution and mediates inputs and artifacts\056 Where it stops\072 a chamber can be flawed\054 and permitted openings can carry harm\056 Isolation depends on correct host\057runtime configuration\054 patching and release rules\073 destroying the box does not erase external copies\056)
>>
endobj
