/Alt (VISUAL LAB 21A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Pass the CSV through the glovebox opening\056 An authorized analyst requests a sales chart for store S\0557\056 The harness obtains only the required rows and exposes them to a disposable execution environment\056\056 Protected harness\056 Credential stays here\056 Fetch S\0557 rows only\056 Write sales\056csv read\055only\056 Execution chamber\056 sales\056csv\072 240 scoped rows\056 Network denied\073 no secrets\056 Scratch 20 MiB\073 time 30 s\056 Release inspection\056 out\057chart\056png\072 parse image\056 Check size and user entitlement\056 Reject unrelated output files\056 Harness passes scoped data\054 not its credential\056\056 Only inspected\054 authorized artifacts may leave\056\056 Locate the credential outside the execution chamber\056\056 The generated program receives the authorized data slice only\056\056 The output gate checks content and entitlement before release\056\056 PREDICT\056 Does a chart\056png filename alone satisfy the release gate\077\056 Contain input authority and inspect output release separately\056\056 Fictional limits\073 the runtime enforces them externally\056 Destruction removes the execution copy under its contract\054 not every retained artifact\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
