/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 A records office with controlled folders A records office labels files\054 checks who may borrow them\054 records their purpose and follows a retention schedule\056 Sending a folder to another office needs an approved destination\054 but destination approval alone does not authorise every person or every use\056 Agent governance follows each copy through models\054 tools\054 memory and logs\056 Where it stops\072 digital copies and derived summaries can spread invisibly\056 Labels and written schedules help only when enforcement and lineage locate every relevant copy and exception\056)
>>
endobj
