/Alt (VISUAL LAB 22A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 One deletion request\054 two retention conditions\056 Record C\0557 appears in live state\054 a derived evaluation sample and backups\056 A verified deletion request arrives\056 Compare handling with no applicable hold against a verified hold covering C\0557\056\056 Delete C\0557 and derived copies under the applicable policy\056\056 No applicable hold\056 Locate live and derived copies by lineage\056 Delete eligible copies\073 record completion\056 Schedule backup expiry and restore suppression\056 Live deletion confirmed\073 backup expiration remains pending\056 Verified scoped hold\056 Validate hold H\0553 covers C\0557 and its purpose\056 Restrict held copies\073 delete eligible extras\056 Record deferred deletion and next hold review\056 Covered records retained under hold\054 with controlled access\056 Both paths start with the same record lineage and verified request\056\056 The hold changes which copies are currently eligible for deletion\056\056 Neither live deletion nor a hold proves all backup copies disappeared\056\056 PREDICT\056 May the no\055hold path report immediate deletion from all backups\077\056 Deletion follows lineage\054 eligibility and each storage contract\056\056 Fictional retention policy\073 verified holds and backup schedules are organization\055specific\056 No universal legal rule or deletion deadline is implied\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
