/Pg 175 0 R
/K 3
/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 A delivery desk with tracking and recovery A delivery desk assigns each shipment a tracking identity\054 waits only a bounded time for updates and distinguishes delayed\054 delivered\054 returned and missing parcels\056 It does not send another parcel merely because a phone call dropped\056 If a trip cannot finish\054 staff arrange documented returns and escalate unresolved items\056 Where it stops\072 a tracking number prevents duplicates only if the carrier enforces it\056 Compensation may not restore the original situation\054 and records can lag behind effects\056 Recovery must reconcile that uncertainty\056)
>>
endobj
5253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 3329 0 R
/Pg 1795 0 R
/K 0
/Alt (VISUAL LAB 23A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Which parcel actually exists\077\056 A replacement saga recorded inventory\054 shipment and fee intents\056 The shipment response timed out\056 Recovery now has three observations\073 decide which conclusions each can establish\056\056 CLAIMS\056 PASSAGES\056 C1\056 Shipment S\05591 was created\056\056 S1\056 Carrier lookup for OP\055S91\072 succeeded\073 shipment S\05591\073 status prepared\056\056 C2\056 The shipment timeout proves no parcel was created\056\056 S2\056 Client event\072 shipment response deadline elapsed after request submission\056\056 C3\056 The fee charge definitely failed before taking effect\056\056 S3\056 Fee journal\072 OP\055F91 intent saved\073 no result or authoritative lookup yet\056\056 SUPPORTS\056 CONFLICTS\056 INSUFFICIENT\056 Shipment exists\073 fee outcome unknown\056 Reconcile before choosing recovery\056\056 The carrier lookup is evidence of a shipment effect despite the lost response\056\056 The timeout alone describes the caller\047s waiting outcome\056\056 The incomplete fee journal leaves its external effect unresolved\056\056 PREDICT\056 Should recovery cancel the shipment solely because no fee result is recorded\077\056 Reconcile effects before deciding what to compensate\056\056 Fictional saga\073 carrier lookup is authoritative for OP\055S91\056 Absence of a local result does not establish absence of an effect\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
endobj
