/Alt (VISUAL LAB 23B \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 The same refund must reach the same remote record\056 OP\05561 was persisted before payment submission\056 The provider committed refund R\05561\054 then the worker crashed before saving success\056 Recovery occurs 5 minutes later within a documented 24\055hour dedupe window\056\056 Durable recovery\056 OP\05561\072 USD 42 intent\056 Local success absent\056 Executor policy\056 Retry OP\05561 unchanged\056 Replacement OP\05562\056 Payments service\056 OP\05561 maps to R\05561\056 Potential second refund\056 Current checks and same\055intent recovery\056 ALLOW\056 Local absence cannot justify replacement\056 DENY\056 Atomic dedupe returns original result R\05561\056 ALLOW\056 Replacement denied until reconciliation\056 DENY\056 The absent local success record is the crash gap\056\056 The permitted recovery retains the exact operation identity and payload\056\056 The downstream atomic mapping supplies duplicate protection inside its retention contract\056\056 PREDICT\056 What changes if recovery occurs after the provider has discarded OP\05561\077\056 Match the recovery horizon to downstream dedupe retention\056\056 Fictional provider contract\073 current authorization checks remain required\056 Routes represent enforced policy\054 not guarantees created by this drawing\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
