/Alt (VISUAL LAB 23C \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 A dependency budget belongs to every caller\056 Three AegisOps runs share one metrics dependency\056 This constructed 60\055second window permits 3 retry attempts total\054 after transient read failures\056 Admission consumes one allowance permanently for that window\056\056 AVAILABLE AT START\056 3 retries available\056 EVENT \057 CHANGE\056 BALANCE AFTER EVENT\056 Run A\072 admit first retry\056 \0551\056 2 retries available\056 Run B\072 admit first retry\056 \0551\056 1 retries available\056 Run A\072 admit second retry\056 \0551\056 0 retries available\056 Run C\072 deny retry\073 no charge\056 \0530\056 0 retries available\056 Reserve atomically before dispatch\073 admitted retries settle as spent\054 never refunded here\056\056 Run A and Run B consume the same available balance\056\056 The third admitted retry exhausts this shared window\056\056 A completed retry releases no allowance because the ledger limits cumulative attempts\056\056 PREDICT\056 May Run C retry now because it has made no retries of its own\077\056 Bound retry traffic across callers as well as within each request\056\056 Toy 60\055second window\073 atomic shared admission\054 no refunds or replenishment within the shown window\056 Only authorized read retries are eligible\056\056 Check your prediction\056 R23 \057 Google SRE\072 handling overload)
>>
endobj
