/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 A flight simulator and its checklist A simulator lets a crew practise a known engine failure\054 delayed clearance or unexpected instrument reading repeatedly\056 Engineers can inspect whether the required procedures were followed without waiting for the failure on a real flight\056 Fake models and services give agent tests that control\056 Where it stops\072 a simulator demonstrates behaviour under its modelled conditions\054 not every real\055world situation\056 Recorded responses test the harness\073 live\055model decisions and production environments still need evaluation and monitoring\056)
>>
