/Alt (VISUAL LAB 26A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 A missing span is not a missing refund\056 Run R\05577 submitted refund OP\05561\056 Its response span is unavailable\056 A linked resume segment later records an authoritative provider lookup\054 allowing the durable effect record to resolve uncertainty\056\056 Before submission\056 Persist OP\05561 and begin tool span\056 operation\056 OP\05561\056 trace\056 request span recorded\056 effect\137record\056 pending\056 Response gap\056 No usable response span arrives\056 operation\056 OP\05561\056 trace\056 response span missing\056 effect\137record\056 outcome unknown\056 Linked resume\056 Provider lookup confirms R\05561\056 operation\056 OP\05561\056 trace\056 resume linked to R\05577\056 effect\137record\056 refund R\05561 confirmed\056 Missing telemetry cannot prove effect absence\073 reconcile with source\056\056 Green edge \075 changed field\073 gray \075 retained field\056\056 The operation identity remains stable while telemetry visibility changes\056\056 The middle record states uncertainty instead of asserting that nothing happened\056\056 The final effect status comes from the provider\054 not inferred span structure\056\056 PREDICT\056 May an operator create a replacement refund while only the middle frame is available\077\056 Use traces to investigate and authoritative records to establish effects\056\056 Fictional run\073 operational traces may be incomplete\056 Consequential effect records use separate durable access\054 integrity and retention controls\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
