/Alt (VISUAL LAB 28A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Only unused reservation returns\056 A constructed tenant allowance starts at 100 cents\056 Two model attempts settle below their reservations\073 the available balance must retain their actual spend\056\056 AVAILABLE AT START\056 100 US cents available\056 EVENT \057 CHANGE\056 BALANCE AFTER EVENT\056 Reserve attempt A\072 40\056 \05540\056 60 US cents available\056 Settle A at 25\072 release 15\056 \05315\056 75 US cents available\056 Reserve attempt B\072 30\056 \05530\056 45 US cents available\056 Settle B at 22\072 release 8\056 \0538\056 53 US cents available\056 Final availability is 53\073 actual spend is 25 \053 22 \075 47\056 Permits are separate\056\056 A reservation reduces spendable allowance before the provider call\056\056 Settlement returns only the unused part of each reservation\056\056 The final 53 plus settled spend 47 equals the starting 100\056\056 PREDICT\056 If attempt B times out with unknown usage\054 should all 30 cents return immediately\077\056 Settling spend releases unused estimates\054 not the money already consumed\056\056 Constructed cents\073 no other charges\054 overruns or currency conversions\056 Reservations and settlement are atomic\056\056 Check your prediction)
