/Alt (VISUAL LAB 28C \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 The slow branch sets the join time\056 ShopAssist needs two authorized independent reads\072 stock takes 3 seconds and carrier status takes 5\056 Both start at 0\073 synthesis takes 1 second after both return\056 These are constructed timings\056\056 Harness\056 Stock service\056 Carrier service\056 0 s\056 Launch both scoped reads\056 3 s\056 Stock result ready\056 5 s\056 Carrier result ready\056 5 s\056 Join both evidence records\056 6 s\056 Synthesis complete\056 WAIT\072 Stock waits 2 s for carrier\056 Elapsed\072 max\0503\054 5\051 \053 1 \075 6 s\073 serial equivalent\072 9 s\056\056 Event positions show order\054 not elapsed duration\056\056 Both reads start together because neither consumes the other result\056\056 Stock finishing at 3 seconds does not make the combined answer ready\056\056 The model can synthesize only after the slower result arrives at 5 seconds\056\056 PREDICT\056 If stock takes 7 seconds instead\054 when does the answer finish under the same assumptions\077\056 Follow dependencies to calculate elapsed time\073 count all work separately for cost\056\056 Constructed timings\073 ample capacity\054 simultaneous dispatch\054 no failures\054 and zero dispatch\057join overhead\056 Diagram spacing represents order\054 not duration\056\056 Check your prediction\056 R28 \057 Anthropic\072 Building effective agents)
