/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 A hospital across staff shifts A hospital reception desk registers requests\054 staff prioritise care and patient records let another shift continue an obligation\056 Shared services such as the laboratory remain independently responsible for their work\056 The chart\054 not one doctor\047s memory\054 preserves the case\056 Where it stops\072 a digital lease can expire while the previous worker continues\054 and copied records can lag behind real effects\056 A handover tag alone does not guarantee exclusive execution or safe regional recovery\073 fencing\054 versioning and effect reconciliation must provide those properties\056)
>>
