/Alt (VISUAL LAB 29A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Three records behind a worker handover\056 AegisOps run INC\05582 moves from worker A to worker B\056 Its rollback request RB\05582 may already have reached the deployment system\056\056 Worker memory\056 A retains epoch 7\056 B loaded epoch 8\056 Both know run INC\05582\056 Owned run store\056 INC\05582\072 version 19\056 Current owner\072 B\054 epoch 8\056 RB\05582\072 outcome unknown\056 Deployment service\056 RB\05582 operation record\056 Revision and receipt lookup\056 Downstream dedupe contract\056 Run store fences stale worker updates by epoch\056\056 Operation lookup resolves what checkpoint cannot\056\056 Two workers can hold copies of the same run simultaneously\056\056 The durable owner record decides whose new progress is accepted\056\056 The deployment record\054 not copied memory\054 establishes RB\05582 outcome\056\056 PREDICT\056 Can B infer that no rollback happened because its checkpoint says outcome unknown\077\056 Shared state preserves continuity\073 ownership and effect evidence establish safe continuation\056\056 Fictional records\073 trusted atomic ownership and a documented deployment lookup\057deduplication contract are assumed\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
endobj
