/Alt (VISUAL LAB 29B \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 A living worker can have stale authority\056 Worker A pauses while holding epoch 7\056 The coordinator assigns epoch 8 to B\056 A later resumes and tries to advance INC\05582\056\056 Worker A\056 Owner \057 store\056 Effect gateway\056 t0\056 Load INC\05582 at epoch 7\056 t1\056 Takeover\072 B owns epoch 8\056 t2\056 Resume with old epoch 7\056 t3\056 Reject epoch\0557 state write\056 t4\056 Reject epoch\0557 new effect\056 WAIT\072 A pauses beyond lease expiry\056 A is alive\054 but cannot write state or start a protected effect\056\056 Event positions show order\054 not elapsed duration\056\056 The pause ends after ownership has already changed\056\056 State rejection protects the latest run record from stale overwrite\056\056 The effect gateway independently rejects stale authority for a new operation\056\056 PREDICT\056 What breaks if only the state store checks the epoch\077\056 Fence both state advancement and new protected effects\056\056 Fictional sequence\073 all protected effect routes consult authoritative epochs\056 Positions show order\054 not elapsed duration\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
