/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 The railway dispatch office A dispatch office schedules stations to report\054 combines their reports under agreed rules\054 records the journey and authorizes the next movement\056 Some reports arrive together\073 a train can wait for clearance without occupying the office staff\056 A graph has the same separation between scheduled work\054 merged state\054 recorded progress and the next decision\056 Where it stops\072 software nodes are not literal trains\054 and restoring an old journey record cannot undo a payment\054 rollback or message already sent outside the graph\056)
>>
