/Alt (VISUAL LAB 32C \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 The saved node must still have somewhere to run\056 ShopAssist thread T\05561 paused at approval\137wait in graph G\0554\056 Candidate G\0555 removes that node and introduces review\137card\056 Its deployment check inspects the old checkpoint before permitting continuation\056\056 Paused thread T\05561\056 owner\056 Northwind support\056 saved graph\056 G\0554\056 pending node\056 approval\137wait\056 candidate graph\056 G\0555\072 review\137card only\056 Owned snapshot\056 PASS\056 Trusted server record\073 owner verified\056 Pending node exists\056 FAIL\056 G\0555 removed approval\137wait\056 Business continuation\056 WAIT\056 Blocked until migration is tested\056 Keep T\05561 on compatible behavior or migrate explicitly\056\056 The checkpoint is intact and belongs to the right tenant\056\056 G\0555 still cannot resume the named pending node\056\056 Deployment compatibility and business approval require different evidence\056\056 PREDICT\056 Can the operator safely fix this by editing approval\137wait to review\137card in the checkpoint\077\056 Test stored pending work against the next graph\054 including the business meaning of continuation\056\056 Fictional application compatibility gate\073 no automatic state rewrite occurs\056 Ordinary behavior pinning never overrides current emergency restrictions\056\056 Check your prediction\056 R32 \057 LangGraph\072 Graph migrations)
