/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 Connecting a new building to a city A new clinic needs rooms\054 water\054 electricity\054 roads and emergency access\056 The architect defines what each connection must supply\073 local utilities determine how it is installed\056 Moving the same clinic design to another city changes suppliers\054 permits and maintenance arrangements\056 An agent platform similarly joins an existing cloud and enterprise fabric\056 Where it stops\072 cloud services with similar purposes can have different delivery\054 identity and recovery semantics\056 A matching label in a catalogue does not make them interchangeable\056)
>>
