/Alt (VISUAL LAB 33A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Managed execution stops at business authority\056 A managed runtime investigates INC\05582\056 The application owns proposal approval and effect intent\073 the deployment service owns the atomic revision check and actual rollback\056\056 Managed execution\056 Untrusted model intent\056 Managed session state\056 App authority\056 Policy \053 approval P\0559\056 Intent ledger RB\05582\056 Domain service\056 Scoped change executor\056 Revision \053 effect record\056 Proposal data\073 no authority\056 ALLOW\056 Owned run reference\054 not approval\056 ALLOW\056 Bound grant\073 executor checks live state\056 ALLOW\056 Direct model\055to\055mutation path blocked\056 DENY\056 The provider operates execution\073 application policy owns the action grant\056\056 Session state can identify a run but cannot certify approval\056\056 The denied route must be enforced by credentials and executor policy\056\056 PREDICT\056 If the managed runtime reports success\054 which record proves the rollback actually applied\077\056 Managed infrastructure does not inherit application authority or establish domain outcomes\056\056 Fictional deployment\073 drawn boundaries assume tested identity\054 credential and executor enforcement\056 Model intent remains untrusted data\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
