6345 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Note
/P 3329 0 R
/Pg 239 0 R
/K 3
/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 Choosing a treatment with a careful clinician A clinician does not prescribe every available treatment\056 They identify the problem\054 choose a treatment whose benefits fit it\054 consider side effects\054 and check whether the patient improves\056 Architecture selection similarly needs indications\054 limits and evidence\056 A sophisticated pattern can be the wrong prescription for a simple task\056 Where it stops\072 software design is not clinical diagnosis\054 and no architecture flowchart decides the answer automatically\056 Organizational authority\054 operating capacity and observed workload behavior must still be examined directly\056)
>>
endobj
6346 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 3329 0 R
/Pg 2337 0 R
/K 0
/Alt (VISUAL LAB 35A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Choose control for the work in front of you\056 ShopAssist splits a billing dispute into a known refund procedure and exploratory diagnosis\056 Use these two known work classes to inspect the smallest necessary control\056\056 Which part of the dispute needs control\077\056 Known procedure\056 Can approval outlive the connection\077\056 YES\056 YES\072 durable workflow and owned wait\056 NO\056 NO\072 bounded deterministic workflow\056 Open investigation\056 Do required permissions need separation\077\056 YES\056 YES\072 scoped workers\073 validate benefit\056 NO\056 NO\072 start with one bounded investigator\056 The root separates two parts of one product\054 not competing product labels\056\056 A durable wait follows lifecycle needs\054 not the number of model calls\056\056 Separate permissions can justify workers\073 their coordination still needs evidence\056\056 PREDICT\056 If investigation uses an agent\054 may it choose to skip the mandatory refund approval\077\056 Match adaptive control to uncertain work and preserve fixed obligations around it\056\056 Fictional design exercise limited to known\055procedure and exploratory work\073 operational capacity and measured benefits still require review\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
endobj
