/Alt (Figure 35\0561\056 Add patterns for specific responsibilities\056 These are review layers\073 each may use several small mechanisms without becoming a separate service\056 A pattern belongs where a concrete requirement needs its contract\056 Diagram labels in reading order\072 Task control\073 Workflow\054 bounded loop or validated router\073 Knowledge\073 Retrieval and governed quantitative evidence\073 Collaboration\073 Scoped specialists only where benefits justify them\073 Authority and recovery\073 Approval\054 effect safety and fail\055safe continuation\073 Operating evidence\073 Tests\054 measurements\054 budgets and runbooks)
>>
