/Alt (Figure 35\0562\056 Fixed work and discovered work\056 One task can contain both fixed control and adaptive investigation\056 The useful architecture is often a hybrid with a clear joining contract\056 Diagram labels in reading order\072 Known refund procedure\073 Read current payment\073 Validate eligibility\073 Bind required approval\073 Dispatch and reconcile effect\073 Open dispute investigation\073 Choose evidence source\073 Test a competing explanation\073 Stop when evidence is enough\073 Return findings to fixed procedure)
>>
