/Alt (Figure 35\0563\056 Six questions that can stop launch\056 Each question has evidence and a named reviewer\073 none is answered by a confident demo\056 A design review verifies promises made by the interfaces\056 Diagram labels in reading order\072 Reviewed design\073 Outcome\073 Does completion mean the user\047s goal is verified\077\073 Authority\073 Can an untrusted proposal cross into an effect\077\073 Recovery\073 What survives a crash or unknown outcome\077\073 Evidence\073 Can each important decision be reconstructed\077\073 Operations\073 Who diagnoses\054 stops and restores the system\077\073 Value\073 Does added complexity improve measured work\077)
>>
