6380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 3329 0 R
/Pg 2341 0 R
/K 0
/Alt (VISUAL LAB 35B \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Cut optional critique before required verification\056 A constructed ShopAssist run has 100 cents\056 The design reserves verification capacity before optional critique\073 the ledger shows actual work and release of unused reservation\056\056 AVAILABLE AT START\056 100 US cents available\056 EVENT \057 CHANGE\056 BALANCE AFTER EVENT\056 Gather evidence\072 settled 45\056 \05545\056 55 US cents available\056 Reserve required verification\072 20\056 \05520\056 35 US cents available\056 Draft proposal\072 settled 10\056 \05510\056 25 US cents available\056 Verify at 15\072 release unused 5\056 \0535\056 30 US cents available\056 Actual spend 70\073 final availability 30\056 Verification reserve is not optional headroom\056\056 The verification reservation reduces available balance before the draft\056\056 After drafting\054 only 25 cents are available for optional work\056\056 Settlement returns 5 unused cents\073 the 15 spent on verification stays charged\056\056 PREDICT\056 At the 25\055cent balance\054 may a 30\055cent critic run by borrowing the verification reservation\077\056 A simpler design retains the checks that establish the promised outcome\056\056 Constructed spend\073 atomic reservations and bounded verifier cost are assumed\056 No measured benefit from the optional critic is claimed\056\056 Check your prediction)
>>
endobj
6381 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 3329 0 R
/Pg 2333 0 R
/K 0
/Alt (VISUAL LAB 35C \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Remove the capability no role needs\056 A ShopAssist review maps four capabilities to three roles\056 Applying P\05540 is allowed only for its scoped executor after valid bound authority and atomic payment checks\056 No role needs payment\055history deletion\056\056 Investigator\056 Proposal service\056 Effect executor\056 Read owned payment\056 ALLOW\056 ALLOW\056 ALLOW\056 Draft refund proposal\056 ALLOW\056 ALLOW\056 DENY\056 Apply approved P\05540\056 DENY\056 DENY\056 ALLOW\056 Delete payment history\056 DENY\056 DENY\056 DENY\056 Remove the unused deletion API\056 Preserve narrow execution\054 bound authority and effect recovery\056\056 The investigator can inspect and propose without applying a refund\056\056 Only the scoped executor can apply P\05540 under the stated conditions\056\056 Every role denies deletion\054 so exposing it adds surface without serving this task\056\056 PREDICT\056 Would combining the investigator and executor into one unrestricted credential be the same simplification\077\056 Simplify the exposed capability surface while preserving the boundary that authorizes effects\056\056 Fictional role policy\073 allow never bypasses tenant scope\056 P\05540 authority\054 live accounting and downstream effect identity must still be enforced\056\056 Check your prediction\056 R35 \057 Google SRE\072 Simplicity)
>>
endobj
