/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 Building a workshop before handing over its keys A workshop first needs an agreed purpose\054 sound structure\054 visible instruments\054 tested procedures and controlled access\056 Only after those are checked should a powerful machine be enabled\056 AegisOps is built in the same order\072 define the task\054 establish observation\054 prove reasoning\054 then grant narrow authority\056 Where it stops\072 read tools are not risk\055free windows\056 They can expose sensitive data and carry hostile text\054 so confidentiality and input boundaries begin before any production mutation\056)
>>
