/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 Observing a patient after treatment A procedure being completed does not establish recovery\056 The care team observes the patient\054 checks for new problems\054 and records whether the treatment helped\056 It also practices unusual situations and reviews failures so the next case improves\056 AegisOps similarly separates applied change from sustained service recovery and turns rehearsal findings into regression tests\056 Where it stops\072 software SLOs and medical outcomes are different\056 The observation window and acceptance criteria here are explicit service contracts\054 not clinical rules\056)
