/Alt (VISUAL LAB 39A \057 SEE \267 TRACE \267 PREDICT\056 Bring receipts to the capstone review\056 A reviewer inspects three fictional portfolio artifacts\056 Decide what each record establishes before accepting the author\047s broader completion statement\056\056 CLAIMS\056 PASSAGES\056 A\056 RF\05540 produced one refund across the injected retry\056\056 RA\056 Fake provider ledger\072 RF\05540 has one effect\073 retry returned its stored receipt\056\056 B\056 Marketplace orders are excluded from the approved view\056\056 RB\056 Approved view schema has no seller\055type field\073 population scope is unspecified\056\056 C\056 The repair changed only permitted production paths\056\056 RC\056 Trusted\055base diff guard\072 repair edited protected tests\057payment\137test\056py\073 denied\056\056 SUPPORTS\056 INSUFFICIENT\056 CONFLICTS\056 A holds for the fake\073 B lacks population evidence\073 C fails the path\055policy gate\056\056 A cites the provider\055side record rather than repeated assistant confirmation\056\056 B turns an absent dimension into an unsupported population claim\056\056 C conflicts with the independent guard even if the edited tests pass\056\056 PREDICT\056 Does artifact RA certify that a real provider will never duplicate a refund\077\056 Judge each capstone by evidence specific to its risky boundary\056\056 Fictional portfolio receipts\073 the refund fake retains the operation key throughout this retry\056 No live deployment outcome is claimed\056\056 Check your prediction)
