/ActualText (ANALOGY \057 Reading an accident investigation A published investigation reconstructs the sequence and asks how the system permitted it\054 rather than stopping at blame\056 Pilots and engineers study such reports to rehearse situations they hope never to face\056 These fictional cases serve that purpose for agents\056 Where it stops\072 they are teaching composites\054 not official accident findings or measured evidence about the frequency of real deployments\047 failures\056)
>>
